type: image
style: comic character sheet
aspect: 4:3
resolution: 1536x1152

prompt: |
  Character expression sheet for a comic-style learning robot mascot.
  Grid of 9 headshots (3x3) showing different emotions:
  Row 1: Excited (stars in eyes), Thinking (hand on chin, thought bubble with "?"),
          Eureka (lightbulb above head, wide smile)
  Row 2: Confused (sweat drop, squiggly mouth), Determined (furrowed brow, clenched fist),
          Celebrating (confetti, arms up)
  Row 3: Reading (glasses on, book open), Explaining (pointing up, speech bubble with "!"),
          Sleeping (ZZZ, head on desk)
  Clean thick black outlines. Flat color fills. Halftone shading on shadows.
  Robot design: round head, antenna, expressive LED eyes, metallic blue body.
  White background with thin black grid separating expressions.
  Style: consistent character model sheet for a comic/manga-influenced learning platform.

usage: Inline character reactions throughout lessons — each expression used contextually
  (confused = "this is tricky", eureka = "key insight", etc.)
